{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.20069203694661453,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.71107266632484734,"h":0.017545608643304234,"c":1,"y":0.055232557831100149},{"y":0.10319767413692649,"x":0.23010380403107264,"t":"Ideas are logically organised, and cohesive devices are varied. Reference is used","h":0.017516111476676643,"w":0.66089965820312491,"c":1},{"y":0.12063953491038759,"x":0.22837369385182391,"t":"[when | those] but with some inaccuracy [that facilities]. Some effective linking","w":0.64359863281249985,"h":0.018968582820692137,"c":1},{"w":0.65935256958007815,"y":0.13680490217313912,"h":0.021802082689097113,"c":1,"x":0.23174125992707484,"t":"devices are used [On the one hand | Firstly | Secondly | On the other hand | On"},{"x":0.23002447499884493,"w":0.67143971761067711,"h":0.022495189690773354,"c":1,"y":0.15583291321990189,"t":"top of this]. However, paragraph 2 is one sentence, and should be combined with"},{"x":0.23003037934295018,"h":0.020559870838034455,"w":0.36178705851236975,"t":"paragraph 3 for a more logical progression.","y":0.17458629159430916,"c":1},{"y":0.20188943316666119,"w":0.59169550577799479,"t":"Vocabulary is a strength, with frequent high-level items and some skilful","h":0.019040799124245944,"c":1,"x":0.23010380152276733},{"h":0.019041816198884343,"y":0.22078376516008635,"c":1,"x":0.23010380532398719,"t":"collocation [of paramount importance | differing views | watch any content]","w":0.62283737182617183},{"x":0.23010380632234112,"y":0.23827851661240174,"t":"although, some errors remain [devise \/ device] and there are some examples of","w":0.65397923787434897,"h":0.018988924980831046,"c":1},{"w":0.67474049886067711,"h":0.017536454304187377,"c":1,"t":"less precise language [make people feel themselves inside the movie | watchers \/","x":0.22837369501511773,"y":0.25717284825485942},{"c":1,"y":0.27345492688063633,"x":0.22989480118502351,"w":0.25656827290852868,"t":"audiences non-useful places].","h":0.021060554525750508},{"c":1,"t":"Grammatical structures are also varied and show some flexibility and some multi-","h":0.018911623304085357,"x":0.23010380147776591,"y":0.3023093068949394,"w":0.66782007853190106},{"y":0.31919877810084629,"x":0.23003103019029955,"h":0.021435608807103934,"c":1,"t":"clause sentences, including modal verbs and [if] clauses. However, most sentences","w":0.67661636352539056},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.34009797077668102,"w":0.66089965820312491,"x":0.23010380404382288,"c":1,"t":"are not error-free, as there are slips with articles, prepositions [in computers \/ on"},{"y":0.35632006118224901,"t":"computers], other simple structures [is | are] and some missing punctuation.","w":0.62469848632812508,"c":1,"h":0.020510232390182792,"x":0.23004661504390847},{"c":1,"w":0.58131490071614578,"x":0.23010379522695851,"t":"To achieve a higher score, the candidate could make the paragraphing","y":0.38517441832259458,"h":0.017554762982421201},{"y":0.40261627909778952,"x":0.23183392060879973,"w":0.62629755655924479,"h":0.019007233659064871,"c":1,"t":"more consistent, and aim for a greater degree of accuracy in vocabulary and"},{"x":0.23010380965858787,"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.42296511601323183,"w":0.19723182678222653,"c":1,"t":"grammatical structures."},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.95639534861866626,"t":"131","w":0.03114186922709139,"c":1,"x":0.87543252550756168}],"h":2857}